                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.825/50: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-06-29T17:00:00+08:00">June 29, 1934—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 29—8:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>279. Reference the Department’s 185, June 25, 5 p.m. Cunningham reports Erbe
                    successfully took examination for pilot on June 27th under special arrangement.
                    Details will be reported by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
